        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let healthy circulation, renewal,\nand maintenance work together throughout your brain\nand the blood vessels in your neck that supply it.\n\nLet blood flow smoothly and evenly,\ncarrying oxygen and nourishment to every part of your brain.\nLet these pathways remain open, strong, and flexible,\nwith renewal and maintenance working together in natural balance.\n\nThis pattern is permanently established within you\nand continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep,\nadjusting to your body's needs without conscious effort.\n\nYour mind becomes clearer, your thinking sharper,\nand your concentration steadier.\nYour thoughts flow smoothly,\nand your responses become quicker and more precise.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern, simply close your eyes.\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nAs you exhale, let this pattern of healthy circulation, renewal,\nand maintenance continue throughout your brain and neck.\n\nThe more you use this command,\nthe easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
