        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let healthy circulation, nourishment, renewal, and maintenance work together throughout your entire body.\n\nLet your blood flow smoothly and evenly through your arteries, veins, and smaller blood vessels, carrying oxygen and nourishment wherever they are needed.\n\nLet these pathways remain open, strong, and flexible, supporting steady and efficient circulation.\n\nYour lungs supply oxygen, and your digestive system provides nourishment. Your blood carries these essential resources throughout your body, while your kidneys, liver, lungs, and other natural systems help process waste and maintain healthy balance.\n\nEvery organ and tissue receives the circulation and nourishment it needs, with blood flow adjusting naturally to your body's changing demands.\n\nThis pattern is permanently established within you and continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, without conscious effort.\n\nYour body's natural circulation and maintenance systems work together smoothly, supporting strength, balance, renewal, and vitality throughout your everyday life.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern, simply close your eyes.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let this pattern of smooth, balanced circulation and natural maintenance continue throughout your entire body.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
