          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "Remember this method for easing physical discomfort.\nClose your eyes and bring the area where you want comfort into your awareness.\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\nSilently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Comfort exercise.",
