        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, whenever you wish to ease physical discomfort,\nyou can use this method to bring comfort to the area you choose.\n\nClose your eyes and bring the area where you want comfort into your awareness.\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let discomfort ease,\nbecoming less intense and less demanding of your attention.\nLet your body settle into comfort and relaxation,\nwhile your mind remains calm, clear, and peaceful.\n\nYou remain aware of your body's needs\nand free to focus on what you choose.\n\nThe more you use this command,\nthe easier and more effective this response becomes.",
