          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-004-Detox.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural processes of cleansing, renewal, and maintenance work together smoothly and efficiently.\n\nYour liver, kidneys, lungs, digestive system, and other natural cleansing pathways each perform their important work.\n\nLet your body retain and use what is beneficial, while processing and eliminating natural waste products and substances it no longer needs.\n\nLet every organ, tissue, and supporting system work together in healthy balance, providing nourishment, protection, maintenance, and renewal throughout your body.\n\nThis pattern is permanently established within you and continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, adjusting naturally to your body's changing needs without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern, simply close your eyes.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let this pattern of natural cleansing, renewal, and maintenance continue throughout your body.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
