          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-005-Appetite-Choice.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to release an unnecessary food craving, recognize the desire you want to release.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Appetite Choice exercise.",
