        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-005-Appetite-Choice.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have greater control over your appetite and your desire for food.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to establish a natural pattern of appetite awareness and conscious choice.\n\nYou recognize the difference between genuine hunger and the desire to eat from habit, boredom, or impulse.\n\nWhen your body needs nourishment, you recognize that need and respond appropriately.\n\nYou become more aware of when you have eaten enough, enjoying your food and recognizing comfortable satisfaction.\n\nThis awareness becomes a natural and automatic part of your everyday life.\n\nWhenever an unnecessary craving arises, you can consciously choose to release it.\n\nRecognize the craving you wish to release.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe unnecessary craving loses its influence over your attention and desire to eat.\n\nYour mind and body return to a comfortable state of satisfaction, allowing you to continue your activities without the unwanted impulse.\n\nYou remain free to enjoy food whenever you choose and continue recognizing your body's genuine nutritional needs.\n\nYour ability to recognize unnecessary cravings and make deliberate eating choices remains permanently established.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" releasing unwanted cravings becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-005.function-body/text"
        },
