        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-006-Heart-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your heart's natural strength,\ncoordination, circulation, and maintenance work together\nin lasting balance.\n\nLet its muscles work smoothly and efficiently,\nwith the strength needed to circulate blood without unnecessary strain.\nLet the signals guiding each heartbeat remain clear and coordinated,\nbringing the heart's activity into a steady, balanced rhythm.\n\nLet the blood vessels within and around your heart\nremain open, strong, and flexible,\nsupplying the oxygen and nourishment it needs.\nLet renewal and maintenance support every part of your heart.\n\nYour heart responds naturally to your body's changing needs,\nincreasing its activity when needed\nand returning to an easy rhythm during rest.\n\nThis pattern is permanently established within you\nand continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep,\nwithout conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern, simply close your eyes.\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe more you use this command,\nthe easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-006.function-body/text"
