        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to reinforce your body's natural blood pressure regulation and cardiovascular balance, close your eyes.\n\nInhale comfortably and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Blood Pressure Balance exercise.",
