        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural systems of blood pressure regulation, circulation, and cardiovascular maintenance work together in healthy balance.\n\nLet your heart and blood vessels work smoothly and efficiently, supporting the circulation of oxygen and nourishment throughout your body.\n\nLet your blood vessels remain healthy, strong, and naturally flexible, responding appropriately to your body's changing needs.\n\nWhen you are resting, let your cardiovascular system settle into calm, comfortable, and efficient activity.\n\nWhen you are active, let your heart and blood vessels adjust naturally, providing the circulation and support your body requires.\n\nLet unnecessary physical tension ease, allowing your breathing, muscles, and mind to return to a comfortable, balanced state.\n\nThis pattern of healthy cardiovascular regulation and maintenance is permanently established within you.\n\nIt continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, adjusting to your body's needs without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this established pattern, simply close your eyes.\n\nTake a comfortable breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let your heart and blood vessels continue working together in natural balance, supporting healthy circulation and appropriate blood pressure regulation.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this conscious reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/text"
        },
