          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-008-Immune-Readiness.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to reinforce your body's natural immune readiness and coordinated protective responses, inhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Immune Readiness exercise.",
