        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-008.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-008-Immune-Readiness.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural immune defenses become stronger, more accurate, and more effective.\n\nThroughout your body, your immune system continually monitors for harmful organisms and other threats, recognizing what requires attention and responding appropriately.\n\nLet your protective immune cells work together with precision, identifying harmful organisms, clearing infected and damaged cells, and coordinating effective defensive responses.\n\nLet your immune system distinguish between what belongs in your body and what may cause harm, protecting healthy tissue while directing its resources where they are needed.\n\nYour immune memory retains knowledge of previous encounters, supporting quicker and more coordinated responses to familiar threats.\n\nWhen a threat has been controlled, let unnecessary immune activity subside, returning your body to its natural, healthy balance.\n\nThis pattern of coordinated immune readiness, protection, and maintenance is permanently established within you.\n\nIt continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, responding to your body's needs without conscious direction or effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this established pattern, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let your body's natural immune defenses continue working with accuracy, coordination, and balance.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-008.function-body/text"
        },
