        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-009.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-009-Breathe-Better.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to reinforce healthy breathing and your respiratory system's natural maintenance, inhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Breathe Better exercise.",
