        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-009.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-009-Breathe-Better.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your entire respiratory system become stronger, healthier, and more efficient.\n\nLet your nose, throat, airways, and lungs work together smoothly, providing the oxygen your body needs.\n\nLet your nasal passages remain clear and comfortable, warming and moistening incoming air, while tiny protective cilia help carry mucus and trapped particles out of your airways.\n\nLet your airways remain open and flexible, allowing air to move smoothly and naturally.\n\nWithin your lungs, millions of tiny air sacs exchange oxygen and carbon dioxide. Oxygen enters your bloodstream to nourish your body, while carbon dioxide passes into your lungs to be released as you exhale.\n\nLet this exchange remain smooth, balanced, and efficient.\n\nYour diaphragm and breathing muscles work together with natural strength and coordination, allowing you to breathe comfortably without unnecessary effort.\n\nYour body's natural processes of maintenance and renewal support the strength, flexibility, and healthy function of your entire respiratory system.\n\nThis pattern of efficient breathing and respiratory maintenance is permanently established within you.\n\nIt continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, adjusting naturally to your body's changing needs without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this established pattern, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let this pattern of smooth, efficient breathing and natural respiratory maintenance continue throughout your body.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-009.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-009.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-009-Breathe-Better.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-009.function-body/version"
        },
