        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-010.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-010-Nutricia.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-010.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-010.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-010-Nutricia.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural processes of digestion, nourishment, and energy utilization work together smoothly and efficiently.\n\nYour body receives the nourishment it needs, uses available energy appropriately, and maintains its natural processes of balance and renewal.\n\nYou have two commands for directing this pattern.\n\nThe first is \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThis mode encourages your body to extract and make fuller use of the available energy and useful nourishment from the food you eat.\n\nThe second is \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-010-FOOD-LESS }}.\"\n\nThis mode encourages your body to obtain sufficient nourishment for healthy function while reducing unnecessary energy retention and storage.\n\nIn either mode, your body's essential nutritional needs remain supported.\n\nNow understand that whichever mode you select becomes your active pattern.\n\nYour selected mode continues automatically throughout your everyday life, including meals, activities, rest, and sleep, without requiring repeated activation.\n\nIt remains active until you deliberately select the other mode.\n\nWhen you switch modes, your new selection replaces the previous one.\n\nTo select or change your mode, simply decide which response you want.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself either \"{{ cue.primary }}\" or \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-010-FOOD-LESS }},\" according to your choice.\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour chosen mode is now established and remains active until you change it.\n\nThere is no need to repeat the command before each meal.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce your current selection, you may use its command again.\n\nThe more familiar you become with these commands, the easier and more natural selecting and reinforcing your chosen mode becomes.\n\nYour body's natural processes of nourishment, energy utilization, and maintenance continue automatically, working in accordance with your selected pattern.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-010.function-body/text"
        },
