        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-011.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-011-Hormonal-Transitions.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural processes of hormonal regulation and adaptation work together smoothly, efficiently, and in healthy balance.\n\nYour body's hormonal systems communicate and coordinate with one another, adjusting naturally to your changing needs throughout life.\n\nLet your body maintain the hormonal balance appropriate for each stage of your life, responding to natural changes without unnecessary strain or imbalance.\n\nDuring periods of hormonal transition, let your body adapt smoothly and comfortably, supporting your physical strength, energy, and natural well-being.\n\nLet unnecessary physical tension and discomfort ease.\n\nYour emotions become calmer and steadier, your thoughts clearer, and your ability to respond to everyday situations more balanced and confident.\n\nYour body continues adapting to its changing needs, maintaining healthy coordination among its natural regulatory systems.\n\nThis pattern of hormonal regulation, adaptation, and balance is permanently established within you.\n\nIt continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, adjusting naturally as your body's needs change without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this established pattern, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let this pattern of healthy hormonal regulation and adaptation continue throughout your body, supporting physical comfort, emotional steadiness, and mental clarity.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this conscious reinforcement becomes.",
