          "value": "Change title from Passages to Hormonal Transitions and update exercise sign-off. Replace two body mentions and one closer mention from Plus Equalize Harmonize to Plus Hormone Balance. Preserve premenstrual/perimenopausal/menopausal/postmenopausal scope, automatic adaptation to changing needs, physical comfort, emotional stability, mental clarity, inhale/hold/cue/candle-like exhale and optional gratitude in closer. Retain Passages and superseded cue as historical lookup; introduce no mode or release. Adaptive balance does not mean fixed hormone levels or permanently heightened endocrine activity; gratitude is not a cue.",
