        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-013-Body-Tune-Up.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to reinforce your body's natural healing, repair, regeneration, and maintenance, simply close your eyes.\n\nYou may include a particular area in your intention, or allow the reinforcement to apply throughout your entire body.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Body Tune-Up exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.closer/text"
