        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-013-Body-Tune-Up.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural processes of healing, repair, regeneration, and renewal work together smoothly and efficiently throughout your entire physical body.\n\nLet every cell, tissue, organ, and supporting system receive the nourishment and care needed to maintain healthy strength, balance, and function.\n\nYour body's natural maintenance systems work together, recognizing areas that need attention and coordinating the appropriate processes of repair and restoration.\n\nLet these processes support your entire body, strengthening natural vitality and maintaining healthy balance.\n\nThis pattern of whole-body maintenance and renewal is permanently established within you.\n\nIt continues automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, adjusting naturally to your body's needs without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this established pattern, you can do so easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes.\n\nIf there is a particular area you wish to support, you may bring that area into your awareness. Otherwise, let the reinforcement apply throughout your entire body.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nAs you exhale, let your body's natural processes of healing, repair, and renewal continue throughout your body, with additional attention to any area you have chosen.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this conscious reinforcement becomes.\n\nYour body's natural maintenance and renewal continue automatically, supporting healthy balance every day and every night.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.function-body/text"
        },
