        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-014-Regenerate.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to direct regeneration toward a specific part of your physical body, close your eyes and think of the part you wish to restore.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Regenerate exercise.",
