        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-014-Regenerate.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your body's natural processes of repair, rebuilding, and regeneration become stronger, more coordinated, and more effective.\n\nYour physical body contains the biological patterns and instructions that guide the formation, maintenance, and renewal of its structures.\n\nLet your cells work together through their natural processes of growth, specialization, and repair, supporting the restoration of healthy tissue and function.\n\nLet circulation supply the oxygen and nourishment needed for this work, while your body's maintenance systems process damaged and unnecessary material.\n\nLet these regenerative processes work together with precision, supporting the reconstruction of healthy structures in their proper form, position, and organization.\n\nThis pattern of repair, reconstruction, and regeneration is permanently established within you.\n\nYour body's natural maintenance and regenerative processes continue automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to direct additional regeneration toward a particular part of your body, you can do so easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and think of the specific part you wish to regenerate.\n\nYou do not need to know its internal anatomy or picture it in your mind. Simply identify the part you wish to restore and its intended healthy function.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nAs you exhale, let your body's natural processes of repair, regeneration, and reconstruction support the selected part, working toward its healthy structure and function.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this conscious reinforcement becomes.\n\nYour body's natural processes of maintenance and renewal continue automatically, supporting the restoration and healthy function of its structures.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.function-body/text"
        },
