        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-001-Information-Access.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to access your personal library of knowledge, first think of a question or the information you desire.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow relevant memories, knowledge, and understanding to come into your conscious awareness.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Information Access exercise.",
