          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-001-Information-Access.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-001-Information-Access.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your ability to access your personal library of information, knowledge, and experience become stronger, faster, and more effective.\n\nEverything you have learned, observed, experienced, and understood contributes to this library of knowledge within you.\n\nYour mind continues organizing this information, connecting related memories, ideas, and experiences, even when you are not consciously thinking about them.\n\nThis ability to organize and access your knowledge is permanently established within you.\n\nWhenever you wish to retrieve information or understand something more clearly, you can call upon this ability directly.\n\nFirst, think of a question or something you wish to know.\n\nThen silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow the relevant information, memories, ideas, and understanding to come into your conscious awareness.\n\nInformation may become available as words, memories, ideas, images, or simple understanding.\n\nThere is no need to experience it in any particular way. Simply recognize what becomes available to you.\n\nYour mind brings together related knowledge and experiences, helping you recognize connections and develop clearer understanding.\n\nSometimes the information becomes apparent immediately. At other times, additional details and connections may emerge naturally as your mind continues working with your request.\n\nEach time you use this command, accessing and recognizing relevant knowledge becomes easier and more familiar.\n\nYour personal library remains available whenever you choose to consult it.\n\nNow, for practice, think of something you would like to remember or understand more clearly.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow whatever relevant information or understanding becomes available to enter your awareness.\n\nYou can use this ability whenever you desire, while your mind continues organizing and connecting knowledge automatically.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/version": {
