          "value": "From this moment forward, let your ability to understand, remember, and work with numbers become stronger, faster, and more accurate.\n\nWhenever you encounter numbers, mathematical symbols, or equations, let their meaning become clear and understandable.\n\nLet numbers and numerical sequences become easier to remember and retrieve whenever you need them.\n\nYour ability to perform arithmetic, algebra, geometry, trigonometry, and advanced mathematical operations becomes faster, clearer, and increasingly precise.\n\nYour mind recognizes relationships between numbers, quantities, shapes, angles, equations, and patterns, understanding how they connect and work together.\n\nLet mathematical principles become easier to recognize and apply, allowing you to approach problems with clarity, confidence, and understanding.\n\nNew mathematical ideas, insights, and solutions emerge naturally into your conscious awareness.\n\nYour calculations become quicker and more accurate, and your ability to recognize useful patterns and solve mathematical problems continues to strengthen.\n\nThis growing mathematical ability is permanently established within you.\n\nYour mind continues organizing and connecting numerical knowledge automatically, whether you are awake, resting, or asleep, strengthening your mathematical understanding through learning and experience.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce these abilities, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let your mind become clear, focused, and responsive to the numbers and mathematical problems before you.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-002.function-body/text"
        },
