        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-003-Contemplation.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to communicate with your total self, close your eyes.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and continue breathing naturally.\n\nWhen you wish to end contemplation, silently say,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-COG-003-CLOSED }}.\"\n\nThis concludes your OCF Contemplation exercise.",
