        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-003-Contemplation.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to communicate with your total self whenever you choose.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, higher self, and deeper aspects of your being are connected as one complete self.\n\nWhenever you wish to open this communication, close your eyes.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and continue breathing naturally.\n\nYour body relaxes while your mind remains calm, awake, and aware.\n\nCommunication throughout your total self opens naturally, allowing knowledge, understanding, and deeper perspectives to enter your conscious awareness.\n\nYou may ask questions, explore ideas, and receive insights from the greater awareness of your total self.\n\nInformation may arise as thoughts, memories, words, feelings, or direct intuitive understanding.\n\nYour subconscious mind and higher self cooperate with your conscious awareness, bringing forward information and perspectives relevant to your contemplation.\n\nYou can recognize and remember the understanding gained through this communication.\n\nThis ability to commune with your total self remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nWhen you wish to end the present contemplation, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-COG-003-CLOSED }}.\"\n\nThe contemplative state ends, and your awareness returns naturally to its ordinary state.\n\nThe knowledge and understanding gained remain available to you.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.function-body/text"
        },
