        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-004.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-004-Imprint.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to consciously capture, store, and recall information and experiences whenever you choose.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, and total self work together to strengthen your ability to remember.\n\nWhenever you wish to preserve information or an experience, direct your attention to what you want to remember.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nKeep your attention on the selected information or experience.\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour mind receives and organizes the selected information, connecting it with your existing knowledge and establishing it within long-term memory.\n\nThe important details of what you have chosen to imprint are preserved and maintained.\n\nYour natural memory processes continue strengthening and organizing this information, whether you are awake, resting, or sleeping.\n\nWhenever you wish to retrieve information you have imprinted, think of what you want to remember.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-COG-004-RECALL }}.\"\n\nThe selected information becomes available to your conscious awareness, allowing you to remember its details and meaning.\n\nYour ability to consciously imprint and retrieve information remains permanently available.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" capturing and retaining information becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-004.function-body/text"
        },
