          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-006-Recall.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to recall information or a past experience, think of what you want to remember.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Recall exercise.",
