        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-006-Recall.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your ability to remember and recall information and experiences becomes stronger, clearer, and more effective.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, and total self work together to organize and retrieve the knowledge and experiences stored within your memory.\n\nWhenever you wish to remember something, think of the information or experience you want to recall.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour mind brings the selected memory or information into your conscious awareness.\n\nRelevant details become clearer, allowing you to recognize and understand what you remember.\n\nYour memory may return through words, thoughts, sounds, feelings, or direct understanding.\n\nYour total self helps you access the knowledge and experiences already available within your memory.\n\nThis ability to recall information and past experiences remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" retrieving memories and learned information becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-006.function-body/text"
        },
