        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-007-Think-Fast.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to think more quickly, clearly, and accurately, inhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Think Fast exercise.",
