        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-007-Think-Fast.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your thinking become faster, clearer, and more accurate.\n\nYour mind processes information quickly, recognizing important details and understanding their meaning.\n\nYour thoughts become organized and precise, allowing you to recognize patterns, connect ideas, and understand complex situations with increasing ease.\n\nYou retain relevant information in your awareness, bringing ideas together to form a clear understanding.\n\nWhenever you encounter a problem, your mind examines the available information, recognizes useful possibilities, and identifies effective solutions.\n\nNew ideas and insights emerge naturally, helping you adapt to changing circumstances and consider different perspectives.\n\nEven when time is limited, your mind remains calm, confident, focused, and alert.\n\nYou think quickly without rushing, responding with clarity, accuracy, and sound judgment.\n\nThis growing ability to think clearly and rapidly is permanently established within you.\n\nYour mind continues strengthening its natural ability to process information, recognize connections, and solve problems through learning and experience.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce your thinking speed and mental clarity, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let your mind become clear, alert, focused, and responsive.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-007.function-body/text"
        },
