          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-com-001.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-com-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COM-001-Speak-Up.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, let your ability to speak, read aloud, and communicate become clearer, stronger, and more effective.\n\nYour thoughts organize naturally into meaningful words, allowing you to express your ideas clearly and accurately.\n\nYou speak fluently and confidently, with comfortable rhythm, precise pronunciation, and natural expression.\n\nYour breathing supports your voice with smooth, steady airflow.\n\nYour vocal cords, throat, tongue, lips, and mouth work together in natural coordination, allowing words to form easily and clearly.\n\nWhenever you read aloud, you recognize written words quickly, understand their meaning, and pronounce them accurately.\n\nYour ideas flow smoothly into spoken expression, helping you communicate exactly what you intend.\n\nWhether speaking with familiar people, meeting someone new, addressing a group, or reading aloud, you remain calm, confident, and articulate.\n\nYou express yourself naturally, without unnecessary hesitation, tension, or effort.\n\nThis ability to speak and communicate clearly is permanently established within you.\n\nYour mind, breathing, and voice continue working together automatically, strengthening your natural fluency and confidence through everyday communication.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this ability, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nAs you exhale, let your thoughts flow into clear, confident speech, allowing you to communicate naturally and effectively.\n\nThe more you use this command, the easier and more effective this reinforcement becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-com-001.function-body/text"
        },
