        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-002.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-002-Offload.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to release an unwanted thought or recurring emotional pattern, first think of what you want to offload.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and continue breathing naturally.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Offload exercise.",
