        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-002.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-002-Offload.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-002.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-002-Offload.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to release unwanted thoughts and emotional patterns that interfere with your awareness.\n\nWhenever a recurring thought, emotional response, or mental pattern no longer serves you, you can choose to release its influence.\n\nSimply think of the unwanted thought or pattern you wish to offload.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and continue breathing naturally.\n\nAs you exhale, let the unwanted thought or emotional pattern lose its hold on your awareness.\n\nIts influence fades, becoming less demanding of your attention until it no longer interferes with your thoughts, emotions, or daily activities.\n\nThe selected pattern becomes quiet and inactive, remaining outside your conscious awareness until you deliberately choose otherwise.\n\nYour memories, knowledge, and valuable understanding remain available, while the unwanted interference fades away.\n\nYour mind becomes clearer and calmer, allowing your attention to return naturally to whatever you choose.\n\nEnergy and attention previously occupied by the unwanted pattern become available for clear thinking, meaningful experiences, and purposeful action.\n\nYou remain in conscious control, choosing what to release and what you wish to retain.\n\nThis ability to offload unwanted thoughts and emotional patterns remains permanently available to you.\n\nOnce you release a selected pattern, your mind naturally maintains freedom from its unnecessary interference.\n\nThe more you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" the easier and more effective releasing unwanted mental and emotional patterns becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-002.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-002.function-body/version": {
