        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to understand or communicate with another being, bring that being into your awareness.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow your total self to establish the connection and become receptive to communication and understanding.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Empathize exercise.",
