        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to establish deeper understanding and communication with another being whenever you choose.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, higher self, and total self work together, expanding your capacity to perceive and understand other forms of consciousness.\n\nThrough your physical senses, you recognize expressions, movements, voices, emotions, and subtle changes in another being.\n\nBeyond your physical senses, your intuitive awareness opens additional channels of understanding and communication.\n\nYou may become aware of another being's feelings, intentions, needs, perspectives, or state of consciousness through impressions, thoughts, emotions, or direct intuitive knowing.\n\nWhenever you wish to understand or communicate with another being, bring that being into your awareness.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow your total self to establish the connection and become receptive to communication and understanding.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, higher self, and greater awareness cooperate, bringing together information and impressions relevant to the being you have selected.\n\nCommunication becomes possible beyond spoken language, through feeling, awareness, intention, and direct understanding.\n\nWhether you are physically present with another being or exploring consciousness in an out-of-body state, this ability remains available.\n\nYour total self connects with the greater consciousness of which all beings are part, opening the possibility of communication beyond ordinary physical limitations.\n\nUnderstanding may arise naturally through thoughts, feelings, impressions, memories, or immediate knowing.\n\nYour awareness remains distinct as you explore another being's perspective, allowing understanding and communication without losing your own sense of self.\n\nYou can recognize and consider the understanding you receive, choosing how to respond and communicate.\n\nThis ability to establish empathetic and intuitive communication remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" establishing deeper understanding and communication becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/text"
        },
