        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-001-Manifest.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to direct your total self toward the reality you choose to create.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, higher self, and greater consciousness work together to bring your intentions into manifestation.\n\nWhenever you wish to manifest a particular outcome, clearly establish what you desire and when you wish it to become reality.\n\nKnow the outcome you are choosing, whether its fulfillment is immediate or sometime in the future.\n\nYou may imagine the completed result, experience its emotional significance, or simply hold the intention clearly within your awareness.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour total self aligns with your chosen intention, bringing your thoughts, awareness, decisions, and actions into harmony with the reality you desire.\n\nYour higher self and greater consciousness cooperate with this intention, guiding the development of circumstances, connections, and opportunities that contribute to its fulfillment.\n\nRelease unnecessary struggle, doubt, impatience, and the need to control every step of the process.\n\nYou may strengthen this alignment through feelings of love, gratitude, inner harmony, or awareness of your heart and energy centers.\n\nRemain receptive to the wisdom and guidance of your higher self, universal consciousness, and the greater awareness available beyond your physical senses.\n\nYour intuition becomes more responsive, helping you recognize meaningful opportunities and directions as they arise.\n\nThe intention you have established continues working within your total self without requiring constant conscious attention or repeated commands.\n\nYour chosen outcome unfolds in harmony with your highest good and the well-being of others, without destructive effects.\n\nRemain open to its fulfillment or an outcome that serves your intention in an even greater way.\n\nThis ability to manifest through conscious intention and total-self cooperation remains permanently available.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" establishing and maintaining alignment with your chosen reality becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-001.function-body/text"
        },
