        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-002.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-002-Insulate.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to establish adaptive insulation, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nUse \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-002-CANCEL }}\" to end the current adjustment, or \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-002-RELEASE }}\" to place the entire application on hold.\n\nUse the same breathing sequence with either command.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Insulate exercise.",
