        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-002-Insulate.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to establish adaptive insulation around your physical body and throughout your total self.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, higher self, and greater consciousness work together to maintain this protective balance.\n\nThis insulation adapts to the conditions around you, reducing the influence of unwanted physical, environmental, emotional, and energetic disturbances.\n\nWhen your surroundings are cold, your total self directs this insulation toward preserving comfortable warmth.\n\nWhen your surroundings are hot, it adapts toward maintaining comfortable coolness and balance.\n\nUnwanted environmental disturbances become less intrusive, allowing greater comfort amid changing surroundings.\n\nEmotional pressures, unwanted influences from others, and disruptive energies become less able to disturb your inner harmony.\n\nYour awareness remains clear, and your total self adjusts the insulation according to your changing needs.\n\nWhenever you wish to establish this protection, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour total self establishes the insulating pattern, naturally adjusting its strength and character to maintain comfort and balance.\n\nYour higher self and greater consciousness cooperate with this intention, guiding the insulation toward what best serves your well-being.\n\nThe insulation operates automatically without requiring you to monitor it, imagine a barrier, or consciously select every influence you wish to reduce.\n\nAs your circumstances change, the pattern adapts, allowing beneficial experiences and interactions while reducing unwanted disturbances.\n\nThe established insulation continues until you deliberately change, cancel, or release its present application.\n\nWhenever you wish to end the current insulation adjustment, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-002-CANCEL }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe current adjustment ends, allowing you to establish a different one whenever desired.\n\nWhenever you wish to place the entire Insulate application on hold, bring Insulate into your awareness.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-002-RELEASE }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe present application rests, while your learned ability remains available whenever you choose to use it again.\n\nThis ability to establish and adjust adaptive insulation is permanently available within your total self.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" establishing and maintaining this balance becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-002.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-002.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-002-Insulate.yaml",
