        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-003-Dissolve.yaml",
          "value": "New OCF-authored programming passage, not a transcription or synonym-only rewrite of the supplied comparison. Preserves deliberate selection, inhale-hold-command-exhale, total-self cooperation, dissolution rather than temporary concealment, and energy available for constructive use. Adds representation-neutral intention, useful learning retained without repeating an old pattern, self-directed choice, and patient integration without requiring distress or a fixed completion time. The ability is intended to remain available; activation targets a consciously selected pattern rather than every passing thought. No clinical or external outcome is established by these suggestions. The supplied meditation prerequisites and Focus-state sequence are not imported. One passage is intended for four scheduled body repetitions; composition remains separate. The proposed primary command is Plus Dissolve, supplied through cue.primary after registration and review. Manifest remains independent. Editorial, rights/provenance, integration, and audio review are pending.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-003-Dissolve.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-003-Dissolve.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to dissolve unwanted beliefs, expectations, emotional responses, and recurring patterns whenever you choose.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical being, higher self, and total self work together to release patterns that no longer serve you.\n\nWhenever you wish to dissolve a particular pattern, identify what you want to release.\n\nIt may be an unwanted belief, an expectation, an emotional response, or a recurring pattern in your life.\n\nRecognize the selected pattern without needing to examine every experience or circumstance that created it.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour total self responds to your intention, beginning the dissolution of the selected pattern throughout your conscious and subconscious awareness.\n\nThe beliefs, expectations, and emotional connections maintaining the unwanted pattern begin to lose their influence.\n\nThe pattern releases its hold over your thoughts, feelings, choices, and responses.\n\nYour higher self and greater awareness cooperate with this release, allowing the old pattern to dissolve completely.\n\nUseful memories, knowledge, and understanding remain available without continuing to reinforce the unwanted pattern.\n\nThe emotional energy and attention previously occupied by the pattern become available for new experiences, creativity, and purposeful action.\n\nThis dissolution continues naturally without requiring constant conscious attention or repeated commands.\n\nAs the selected pattern dissolves, your total self establishes lasting freedom from its unwanted influence.\n\nThe learned ability to dissolve unwanted patterns remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" releasing unwanted patterns becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-003-Dissolve.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.function-body/version"
        },
