          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-003-Dissolve.yaml",
          "value": "New OCF-authored narration proposal informed by the user-supplied Plus Dis-Create excerpt. Introduces conscious dissolution of selected beliefs, emotional responses, and recurring life patterns. No historical transcript identity or prior editorial approval is claimed. Proposed identity OCF-EXP-003 remains subject to registration and review.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-003.opener/notes"
        },
