        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "New OCF-authored reminder, not historical transcript wording. Includes the primary reinforcement/restoration cue and both distinct overrides. The body teaches automatic reset conditions; the closer does not repeat reinforcement or install a new control command. All three commands are breath-independent. Requires registered function and reviewed locale cues. Editorial approval and finished-session review remain pending.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to reinforce or restore your clear personal zone, silently say,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nUse \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-OBSERVE }}\" to temporarily allow intentional insect contact, or \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-SUSPEND }}\" to pause the entire application.\n\nYour normal {{ function.title }} pattern resumes when you invoke its primary command or when a temporary override ends.\n\nThis concludes your OCF {{ function.title }} exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.closer/version": {
