        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "New OCF wording based on the maintainer-supplied Clear Zone draft. Preserves permanent automatic operation as the intended baseline, whole-self participation, non-destructive insect discouragement, primary reinforcement and restoration, and distinct Observe and Suspend overrides. Observe pauses the outward-directed intention while Clear Zone's calm awareness remains; Suspend pauses the whole application without removing learning or ordinary bodily responses. Only one mode is selected at a time; a new selection replaces the previous mode. Normal sleep onset, loss of consciousness, or deliberate primary invocation restores automatic mode. Meditation or hearing a command during instruction does not itself select an override. All three commands are breath-independent and require no eye closure. Quantum terminology is replaced with total-self and intention language rather than a claimed physical mechanism. Primary and mode cues require separate stable command records; the two mode references use explicit same-owner command IDs. One reusable body is intended for four scheduled passes. Shared state transitions and practice pauses remain outside this body. Intended effects and automatic operation are exercise suggestions, not verified insect repellency. Editorial and integration review remain pending.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-005-Clear-Zone.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, {{ function.title }} is permanently established within your total self, maintaining a clear and comfortable space around your entire body.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical being, and higher self work together, naturally discouraging unwanted insect contact.\n\nWhenever insects approach, your total self maintains one clear intention: remain away, move away, and continue peacefully elsewhere.\n\nThis pattern works without harm to other life, preserving your comfort and natural awareness of your surroundings.\n\n{{ function.title }} continues operating automatically, without requiring conscious attention or repeated commands.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce or restore this pattern, simply say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nYour total self strengthens the established intention, maintaining a clear personal space around you.\n\nYou also have two optional commands.\n\nWhen you wish to observe or interact with insects without discouraging their approach, silently say,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-OBSERVE }}.\"\n\nThe outward insect-discouragement intention pauses, while your calm awareness remains available.\n\nWhenever you wish to pause the entire {{ function.title }} application, silently say,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-005-SUSPEND }}.\"\n\nThe application rests, while your ordinary awareness and natural responses continue.\n\nEach selected mode replaces the previous one.\n\nObserve and Suspend are temporary. They end automatically when you enter normal sleep, lose consciousness, or deliberately invoke \"{{ cue.primary }}\" again.\n\nYour original protective pattern then resumes.\n\nYour learned ability remains permanently available, regardless of which mode you choose.\n\nThe more you use these commands, the easier and more natural establishing and adjusting {{ function.title }} becomes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-005.function-body/version": {
