        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-006-Intuition.yaml",
          "value": "Newly AI-authored original candidate. Ongoing intuitive development is the intended baseline; deliberate command use reinforces deeper understanding. The proposed procedure has no prescribed breath pattern or eye closure. Consciousness-oriented language describes the practice, not verified access to external facts or another person's private thoughts. Editorial, procedure, rights and listening review remain pending. One body is proposed for four composed passes; shared preparation and return remain separate.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-006-Intuition.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-006-Intuition.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your intuitive awareness becomes a natural and increasingly accessible part of your everyday life.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical being, higher self, and total self work together, opening deeper channels of awareness and understanding.\n\nThrough this connection, you become more receptive to the wisdom, knowledge, and guidance available beyond your ordinary conscious awareness.\n\nYour intuition draws upon your experiences, subconscious understanding, higher consciousness, and the greater awareness to which your total self is connected.\n\nWhenever you wish to receive intuitive guidance, bring a question or situation into your awareness.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow understanding to arise naturally.\n\nGuidance may come as a thought, impression, feeling, memory, sudden recognition, or direct intuitive knowing.\n\nYour total self brings forward information and understanding relevant to your question, making connections that may not have been apparent to your conscious mind.\n\nYour higher self and wider consciousness contribute their greater perspectives, helping you recognize possibilities, meanings, and directions.\n\nAs intuitive understanding develops, you become more capable of recognizing its significance and applying it to your experiences and decisions.\n\nYou can consider the guidance you receive, allowing it to contribute to your understanding while choosing how to respond.\n\nYour connection with your total self and higher consciousness continues developing naturally, without requiring constant conscious attention.\n\nThis intuitive ability remains permanently available, becoming clearer and more accessible through experience.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" accessing and understanding intuitive guidance becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-006-Intuition.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-006.function-body/version"
