        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Scoped preparation for closing Access without withdrawing the Energy Ball.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Let what you have learned settle into your understanding.\nThe meaning and the cues you have learned remain available to you.\nKeep that learning as you allow this working period to finish.\n\nYour Energy Ball can remain around you as you close this Access Channel.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.access-close-prepare/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Chosen active or withdrawn state is retained.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Notice your body resting against the surface beneath you.\n\nLet your attention include the room and the sounds around you.\n\nYour Energy Ball can remain around you at the size and with the qualities you choose.\n\nThe cues you have learned remain available whenever you want to form, renew, or draw it back within.\n\nTake a moment before you continue.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "2.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/cue_template/allowed/1": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-007-DEFLATE",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/cue_template/allowed/1"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-EXP-007",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "One association body used in two Focus Eleven passes and two quieter sleep passes.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/notes"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "From now on, whenever you choose to establish your Energy Ball, think or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nIf your ball is already expanded, this renews the same ball at the size and with the qualities you have chosen.\n\nYou can change its size, color, or qualities by intention.\n\nIt remains established until you choose to draw it back within.\n\nWhenever you choose to do that, think or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-007-DEFLATE }}.\"\n\nThis draws the entire ball back within, however far you have extended it.\n\nYou can form it again whenever you choose.\n\nYou can use either cue deliberately, with ordinary breathing and your eyes open or closed.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "3.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.function-body/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-continuation/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-continuation/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-continuation/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Let your Energy Ball remain around you as we continue, if that is your choice.\n\nYou can allow it to remain without keeping your attention on it.\n\nDrawing it back within remains an option whenever you want it.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-continuation/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-continuation/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-continuation/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-first/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-first/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-first/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Bring your attention to your heart center, in the middle of your chest.\n\nLet a small sun represent your own gathered energy.\n\nYou can picture its light in any color, sense warmth or movement, or simply know that this is where your Energy Ball begins.\n\nA clear image or physical sensation is not required.\n\nFollow the exercise in whichever way comes naturally.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-first/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-first/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "3.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-first/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-2/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-2/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-2/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Now let that energy open outward from your heart center, growing through and around you.\n\nLet it extend in front of your body.\n\nBehind your back.\n\nTo your left and to your right.\n\nBeyond your head and beyond your feet.\n\nLet it form one complete ball surrounding you, with room around your whole body.\n\nYou are resting at its center.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-2/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-2/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-2/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-3/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-3/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-3/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "If you would like it to expand farther, you can take another comfortable deep breath.\n\nAs you breathe out, imagine gently blowing the ball larger, as though your breath were filling a bubble.\n\nLet it widen smoothly in every direction.\n\nYou can use this breath whenever it helps, or simply choose for the ball to expand.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-3/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-3/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-3/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-4/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-4/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-4/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Now set your Energy Ball turning.\n\nYou can imagine giving the inside of the ball a gentle sideways push.\n\nOr simply choose for it to begin turning.\n\nYou remain comfortably still at its center.\n\nLet its movement become smooth and continuous.\n\nYou can let it accelerate faster and faster, or settle at a speed that feels right to you.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-4/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-4/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-4/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-5/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-5/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-5/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Your ball may remain visible in your mind, become transparent, or have no visual appearance at all.\n\nIt can have any color or combination of colors you choose.\n\nYou may imagine warmth, a flowing current, or the fine tingling of static electricity.\n\nYou can also follow a sense of movement or space, or simply know that the ball is established.\n\nIts appearance does not determine whether it remains around you.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-5/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-5/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-5/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-6/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-6/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-6/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "You may imagine the spinning field taking on magnetic qualities, attracting what you desire and repelling what you do not want.\n\nLet those qualities take whatever form is useful to you.\n\nFor a more open, receptive feeling, imagine the field spreading outward and becoming lighter and less dense.\n\nFor a more contained, steady feeling, imagine it drawing closer and becoming more concentrated.\n\nDrawing it closer changes its size. It can still remain fully around you.\n\nChoose the space and quality you want for this practice.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-6/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-6/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-healing-6/version"
        },
