          "value": "OCF-EXP-007",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "For this practice, imagine filling your ball with protective energy.\n\nChoose a color, a feeling, or a quality that expresses protection and balance for you.\n\nIt may be different from what you chose for healing, or it may be the same.\n\nYou can also simply hold the intention, without any image or sensation.\n\nIf you have learned {{ function.title.OCF-FND-001 }} and would like to use it here, first choose the purpose or result you want from this protection practice.\n\nThen think or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-FND-001-PRIMARY }}.\"\n\nHold your intended result in your awareness.\n\nYou can also continue by simply imagining or intending the protective quality you have chosen.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-2/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-3/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-3/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-3/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "You can let your ball feel closer and more concentrated, expressing steady boundaries.\n\nOr give it more space and an open, receptive quality.\n\nSize, color, and the qualities you choose can be adjusted separately.\n\nA larger ball can still represent protection, and a closer ball need not represent shutting everything out.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-3/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-3/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-3/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-4/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-4/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-4/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "If you would like your ball to surround more than your own body, choose what you want to include.\n\nIt might be you and your bicycle, your vehicle and its passengers, your home, or a loved one beside you.\n\nImagine the ball expanding beyond that space, in front, behind, to either side, above, and below.\n\nUse another comfortable breath if it helps, imagining the bubble growing larger as you breathe out.\n\nGive everything you have chosen room within it.\n\nIf you include another person, let this express your wish for their wellbeing, with their feelings and choices remaining their own.\n\nYou may also keep the ball at its present size around you.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-4/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-4/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-4/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-start/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-start/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-start/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Let it continue turning, with the protective qualities you have chosen.\n\nKeep any color or appearance that is useful to you, or simply know that it is there.\n\nSpend the next minute becoming familiar with this experience while your ball remains expanded.\n\nI will tell you when we continue.\n\nBegin now.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-start/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-start/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "1.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-protection-start/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-second/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-second/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-second/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "Now turn to protection and balance.\n\nIf you drew your ball back within, let the familiar energy at your heart center expand around you again.\n\nIf it is still around you, continue with the same ball.\n\nLet it turn smoothly at the size and speed you choose.\n\nThe extra breath and the imagined push are there whenever you find them helpful.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-second/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-second/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "3.0.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-second/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-withdrawal/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-withdrawal/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-withdrawal/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-007-Energy-Ball.yaml",
          "value": "You can keep your Energy Ball around you, or practise drawing it back within.\n\nIf you would like to practise withdrawing it now, let the spinning settle as you allow the whole ball to draw inward.\n\nIf you choose to draw it within, gather all of its energy back through your heart center, however far you have extended it, and let it settle throughout you.\n\nIf you prefer to keep it around you, leave it established and simply understand how you could draw it back within whenever you choose.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-withdrawal/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-007.guided-withdrawal/version": {
