          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to strengthen your concentration, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour attention naturally focuses on whatever you are doing.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Focus exercise.",
