        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-002-Focus.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to direct and sustain your attention with greater clarity and concentration.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to focus your awareness.\n\nWhenever you wish to concentrate, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour attention naturally centers on whatever you are doing or choose to do.\n\nUnnecessary distractions fade, allowing you to concentrate more clearly and steadily.\n\nYour mind and senses work together to recognize important details and understand what you are experiencing.\n\nInformation relevant to your current activity becomes easier to recognize, understand, and remember.\n\nYour concentration remains steady without unnecessary mental strain, naturally following your attention as you move between activities.\n\nThis ability to focus remains permanently available.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" directing and sustaining your attention becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-002.function-body/text"
        },
