        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-003-Quick-Recharge.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to recharge your body and mind through a short period of natural, restorative sleep.\n\nWhenever you wish to take a brief rest, settle into a comfortable position where you can safely sleep.\n\nAllow your body and mind to relax.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour body and mind naturally enter a peaceful, restorative sleep.\n\nAs you rest, your conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to restore balance and replenish your energy.\n\nUnnecessary tension releases, your mind settles, and your natural restorative processes support renewed strength and vitality.\n\nThroughout this brief period of sleep, your total self works toward restoring your physical and mental energy.\n\nAs your short rest completes, you awaken naturally, refreshed, alert, and ready to resume your activities.\n\nThis ability to enter a short restorative sleep remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" entering restful sleep and awakening refreshed becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-003.function-body/text"
        },
