          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-004-Relax.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to relax your entire body and mind deeply and naturally whenever you choose.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to release unnecessary tension and restore balance.\n\nWhenever you wish to relax, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nUnnecessary physical tension releases throughout your body.\n\nYour muscles relax, your breathing becomes smooth and natural, and your body settles into a comfortable state of ease.\n\nMental tension and unnecessary effort diminish, allowing your thoughts to become quieter and clearer.\n\nYou can use this ability while resting or remain comfortably alert when you need to think, move, or act.\n\nYour body and mind naturally respond to the intention to relax, without requiring conscious attention to individual muscles or areas.\n\nThis ability to enter a state of physical and mental relaxation remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" releasing tension and entering relaxation becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-004.function-body/text"
        },
