        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-005-Reset.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to quickly reset your physical and mental state whenever you choose.\n\nWhenever you feel tired, weary, or emotionally low, you can shift into a renewed state of energy, clarity, strength, and confidence.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to restore your natural balance and alertness.\n\nTo activate this ability, take a deep breath in, close your eyes, and gently hold your breath.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nYour physical and mental state begins to change immediately.\n\nWeariness and heaviness diminish as renewed energy and vitality become available throughout your body.\n\nYour mind becomes clearer and sharper, supporting focused attention and effective action.\n\nYour emotions return toward balance as confidence, strength, and steady awareness increase.\n\nYour total self establishes the refreshed, alert state you have chosen.\n\nThis ability to reset your physical and mental state remains permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" making this change becomes easier and more natural.",
