        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-006-Release.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to release the temporary application of any OCF function whenever its purpose is complete.\n\nThe functions you have learned remain available, even after their temporary applications end.\n\nWhenever you wish to release an application, identify the function you want to end.\n\nYou may also select a group of temporary functions and release their current applications together.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe selected function's temporary application ends, and its active effects fade naturally.\n\nYour body and mind return to their normal state as the temporary response concludes.\n\nAny selected group of temporary applications ends together.\n\nOther functions and lasting abilities continue unaffected.\n\nYour knowledge and learned capabilities remain available whenever you choose to use them again.\n\nThis ability to release selected temporary applications remains permanently available.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" ending a temporary application becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-006.function-body/text"
        },
