        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to eliminate unwanted physical and mental habit patterns whenever you choose.\n\nHabits are repeated patterns that become automatic over time. You can recognize and change these patterns at their source.\n\nWhenever an unwanted habit begins to arise, recognize the habit you wish to eliminate.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe unwanted habit begins to lose its influence over your thoughts and actions.\n\nIts familiar impulses grow weaker, allowing your mind and body to respond naturally in the way you choose.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to release the unwanted pattern.\n\nThe old habit continues to fade until it no longer operates as an automatic response.\n\nYour useful memories, knowledge, and skills remain intact as the unwanted behavior loses its place in your life.\n\nThis ability to eliminate unwanted habits is permanently established within you and remains available whenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" changing unwanted habits becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/text"
        },
