        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-002-Inner-Power.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you recognize more fully the strength, wisdom, and power already present within your total self.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, higher self, and entire being work together, bringing your inner capabilities into greater awareness.\n\nYou become increasingly aware of your natural strength, knowledge, confidence, and ability to meet life's challenges.\n\nWhenever questions, opportunities, or difficult situations arise, your total self provides the wisdom, clarity, and strength needed to respond effectively.\n\nYour thoughts and actions become more purposeful, confident, and decisive.\n\nYou draw upon your inner resources naturally, allowing your abilities to express themselves throughout your everyday experiences.\n\nThis recognition of your total self becomes a permanent part of your awareness, continuing to develop through everything you experience.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this connection, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour awareness of your total self strengthens, bringing its wisdom, confidence, and capabilities more fully into your conscious actions.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" recognizing and expressing these abilities becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-002.function-body/text"
        },
