          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-004-Light-Foot.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, your lighter, quieter movement pattern continues naturally.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce it, inhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Light Foot exercise.",
