        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-004.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-004-Light-Foot.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your body learns a lighter, quieter, and more efficient way of moving.\n\nWhether walking, climbing stairs, jogging, or running, your feet and legs work together with natural ease and precision.\n\nYour feet lift cleanly from the ground and return with the pressure needed for stable support.\n\nYour steps become smoother and quieter as unnecessary tension, impact, and wasted movement decrease.\n\nYour posture, balance, and rhythm work together, allowing you to place each foot accurately and adapt naturally to the ground beneath you.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self establish this improved movement pattern as your natural way of moving.\n\nIt continues automatically during everyday activities without requiring conscious attention or repeated commands.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this lightness and efficiency, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour movement becomes lighter, quieter, and more efficient, maintaining balance and awareness appropriate to your surroundings.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" this learned movement pattern becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-004.function-body/text"
        },
