          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-005-Make-Your-Day.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to shape the day ahead, establish the experiences and outcomes you desire for today.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Make Your Day exercise.",
