        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-005-Make-Your-Day.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to shape the experiences, conditions, and outcomes you desire for each day.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, higher self, and total self work together to establish the pattern you choose for the day ahead.\n\nEach morning, before beginning your activities, consider what you wish to experience and accomplish today.\n\nChoose the physical, mental, and emotional conditions you desire, along with the opportunities, circumstances, and outcomes you wish to bring into your day.\n\nEstablish these intentions clearly, knowing what you wish to experience before this day is complete.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour total self responds to your intentions, bringing your thoughts, choices, actions, and greater awareness into alignment with the day you have chosen.\n\nYour subconscious mind and higher self cooperate with your conscious intentions, helping favorable circumstances and opportunities develop throughout the day.\n\nYou recognize possibilities that support your intentions and respond naturally to opportunities as they arise.\n\nThe events and experiences of your day begin unfolding in alignment with the pattern you have established.\n\nRemain open to unexpected opportunities and outcomes that may fulfill your intentions in ways beyond those you initially considered.\n\nThis pattern applies to the current day.\n\nEach new morning, you can establish fresh intentions for the day ahead.\n\nYour ability to shape your daily experiences through conscious intention remains permanently available.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-005.function-body/text"
        },
