        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-006.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-006-Strong-Quick.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, when you need exceptional strength and quickness, identify the action you wish to perform.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nThe enhanced response ends automatically when the need has passed.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Strong-Quick exercise.",
