        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-001.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-001-Hearing.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-001.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-001-Hearing.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to adjust your awareness of sound and strengthen your inner sense of hearing.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical senses, and total self work together to respond to your intentions.\n\nWhenever you wish to hear sounds more clearly, close your eyes.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nYour awareness of sound becomes clearer and more detailed.\n\nSubtle sounds become easier to notice, including differences in pitch, tone, rhythm, and volume.\n\nWhenever you wish to reduce unwanted or distracting sounds, use the same breathing and eye sequence with the command,\n\"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-SEN-001-HEAR-LESS }}.\"\n\nUnwanted sounds, whether coming from your surroundings or arising within your own hearing awareness, become less prominent.\n\nYour attention naturally shifts toward the sounds you wish to hear, while unnecessary ringing, buzzing, humming, and other distracting sounds fade into the background.\n\nYou remain aware of important sounds around you and can change the adjustment whenever you choose.\n\nYour inner sense of hearing also develops, strengthening your ability to remember familiar voices, music, conversations, and other sounds.\n\nYou may recall or imagine sounds with greater clarity, recognizing their details and qualities.\n\nYour total self supports both your awareness of external sounds and your ability to experience sound internally.\n\nThese abilities remain available whenever you choose to use them.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }}\" or \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-SEN-001-HEAR-LESS }},\" adjusting your awareness of sound becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-001.function-body/text"
        },
