          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-001-Restorative-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to direct your total self toward healing, restoration, and regeneration during sleep, simply close your eyes.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth, and continue resting naturally.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Restorative Sleep exercise.",
