        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-001-Restorative-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, whenever you prepare for sleep, you can direct your total self toward deep healing, restoration, and regeneration throughout your rest.\n\nLet this intention extend throughout your entire body and being. If there is a particular area you wish to restore, you may include it in your intention.\n\nWhen you are ready, simply close your eyes.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth, and continue breathing naturally.\n\nAllow yourself to move easily into deep, peaceful, natural sleep.\n\nAs your conscious mind rests, let your subconscious mind, higher self, and physical body work together, directing their natural resources toward healing, repair, renewal, and regeneration.\n\nLet your body's natural maintenance and restorative processes work in harmony, supporting balance, recovery, and renewed vitality throughout your entire being.\n\nAreas of weariness, strain, or imbalance receive the care and attention needed for natural restoration.\n\nThis restorative pattern continues automatically throughout your sleep, without requiring conscious direction, observation, or effort.\n\nAs your sleep is complete, awaken naturally, deeply rested and refreshed, with renewed energy, clarity, and strength.\n\nYour ability to invoke this restorative sleep pattern remains permanently available whenever you choose. Each use makes entering restorative sleep and directing your total self toward renewal easier and more familiar.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-001.function-body/text"
        },
