          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-002-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to enter normal, natural, restful sleep, close your eyes.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen slowly exhale and continue breathing naturally.\n\nAllow yourself to settle into restful sleep.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Sleep exercise.",
