        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-002-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to enter normal, natural, restful sleep whenever you choose.\n\nWhen you are ready for sleep, make yourself comfortable and allow your body and mind to begin relaxing.\n\nSimply close your eyes.\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen slowly exhale and continue breathing naturally.\n\nAs you exhale, allow yourself to move more deeply into peaceful, natural sleep.\n\nYour thoughts become quiet. Unnecessary effort and tension fade away. Your mind and body recognize that the time for sleep has arrived.\n\nYou fall asleep smoothly and naturally, without needing to force the process.\n\nThroughout your sleep, your mind and body settle into their natural rhythms of rest, balance, maintenance, and renewal.\n\nYou enjoy the restful sleep you desire, awakening at your chosen time, refreshed, alert, and ready for the day ahead.\n\nThis ability remains available whenever you consciously choose to use it. At other times, your ordinary waking awareness remains clear and active.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" entering natural sleep becomes easier and more familiar.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-002.function-body/text"
        },
