          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-003-Dream-Theme.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to experience a dream of your choosing, establish the theme you desire.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale and continue breathing slowly and deeply.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Dream Theme exercise.",
