        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-003-Dream-Theme.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to choose the dreams you wish to experience during sleep.\n\nWhenever you wish to dream about something specific, choose the theme or experience you desire.\n\nIt may be a place, person, experience, question, possibility, or world of your own creation.\n\nEstablish your intention for the dream, including any details, experiences, or emotions you wish to explore.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale and continue breathing slowly and deeply.\n\nYour body and mind enter peaceful, natural sleep.\n\nAs you sleep, your conscious intention, subconscious awareness, higher self, and total self work together to develop a dream around your chosen theme.\n\nYour dream unfolds naturally, creating scenes, events, sensations, and experiences connected to your intention.\n\nThe dream may develop in unexpected directions while remaining connected to the theme you have chosen.\n\nYou experience the dream naturally, allowing the events and experiences to unfold.\n\nWhen you awaken, the dream returns clearly to your awareness.\n\nYou remember its events, details, and meaningful experiences, allowing you to reflect upon what you dreamed.\n\nThis ability to choose, experience, and remember your dreams remains permanently available.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" creating and recalling your chosen dream experiences becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.function-body/version": {
