          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-006-Stay-Awake.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability to call upon a powerful state of waking alertness whenever an immediate need arises.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, physical body, and total self work together to support clear, active wakefulness.\n\nWhenever you need to remain awake and alert, take a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth.\n\nYour total self responds immediately, bringing your mind and body into a state of increased alertness.\n\nYour thoughts become clearer, your awareness sharpens, and your attention naturally centers on what is happening around you.\n\nYour senses and physical body work together to support responsiveness, coordination, and clear awareness.\n\nWeariness and mental dullness diminish as your available energy and attention support the present need for wakefulness.\n\nThis enhanced alertness continues for as long as the immediate need exists.\n\nWhen the need passes and you are able to rest, the heightened response ends naturally.\n\nYour learned ability to call upon this state remains permanently available without keeping you continually stimulated.\n\nEach time you use \"{{ cue.primary }},\" entering a state of clear, focused wakefulness becomes easier and more natural.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-006.function-body/text"
        },
